        "确定似然概率",
        "计算全概率",
        "使用贝叶斯定理求后验概率"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "three_event_bayes",
        "template": "$P(E_1|W) = \\frac{P(W|E_1)P(E_1)}{\\sum_{i=1}^{3}P(W|E_i)P(E_i)}$",
        "variable_count": 3
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求选中袋1的概率",
          "steps": [
            "$P(\\text{袋1}) = P(\\text{袋2}) = P(\\text{袋3}) = \\frac{1}{3}$",
            "$P(W|\\text{袋1}) = \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{2}{3}$",
            "$P(W|\\text{袋2}) = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "$P(W|\\text{袋3}) = \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3}$",
            "$P(W) = \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{9} + \\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{1}{9} = \\frac{4 + 3 + 2}{18} = \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "$P(\\text{袋1}|W) = \\frac{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{\\frac{2}{9}}{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{4}{9}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2025-fecac37ff9-q01-practice-01",
      "school": "东京科学大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "一个工厂有两条生产线。生产线甲每天的不合格率为2%，生产线乙每天的不合格率为3%。某天随机选择一条生产线生产100件产品，检验发现有3件不合格。求这3件不合格品来自生产线甲的概率。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "贝叶斯定理",
        "二项分布",
        "条件概率"
      ],
      "question_type": "质量控制中的贝叶斯推断",
      "method": [
        "贝叶斯定理",
        "二项分布概率"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "确定先验概率",
        "计算似然概率（二项分布）",
        "应用贝叶斯定理"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "binomial_bayes",
        "template": "在两个二项分布总体中，根据观测数据推断来源",
        "variable_count": 4
      },
      "difficulty": 4,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求不合格品来自生产线甲的概率",
          "steps": [
            "$P(\\text{甲}) = P(\\text{乙}) = \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "设不合格数为$k$，$P(k=3|\\text{甲}) = \\binom{100}{3}(0.02)^3(0.98)^{97}$",
            "$P(k=3|\\text{乙}) = \\binom{100}{3}(0.03)^3(0.97)^{97}$",
            "$P(\\text{甲}|k=3) = \\frac{P(k=3|\\text{甲})P(\\text{甲})}{P(k=3|\\text{甲})P(\\text{甲})+P(k=3|\\text{乙})P(\\text{乙})} = \\frac{(0.02)^3}{(0.02)^3+(0.03)^3}$",
            "计算：$(0.02)^3 = 8 \\times 10^{-6}$，$(0.03)^3 = 27 \\times 10^{-6}$",
            "$P(\\text{甲}|k=3) = \\frac{8}{8+27} = \\frac{8}{35}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2025-fecac37ff9-q01-practice-02",
